visualization of how we think the

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:19.870
switching is is happening and the ideas
that you begin with your fertilized egg

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:25.180
and then if you track single cells so
that the egg will divide into two and

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:29.410
those two into four and so forth and if
you follow one of those cells throughout

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:34.540
its whole lifetime until the baby is
born for example you know did that cell

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:39.760
turn into a skin cell or blood cell or
what and the idea is that at every point

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:43.540
during development decisions have to be
made to go to the left or to the right

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:48.850
and then as more and more of those
decisions are made it specializes in to

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:56.320
the final adult cell and so you could
have a blood cell or a brain cell and

00:20:56.320 --> 00:21:01.870
it's kind of analogous to ASCII tale and
so suppose you're you're going skiing up

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:08.650
