00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:37.730
some other kind of cell and that's sort
of the concept behind stem cell

00:23:37.730 --> 00:23:43.730
programming and so why is there so much
excitement about epigenetics so again

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:48.500
the basic concept is that you have your
DNA and genes and then epigenetics is

00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:54.050
this layer programming that can kind of
turn things on and off well it turns out

00:23:54.050 --> 00:23:58.240
