00:35:57.200 --> 00:36:03.560
tissues and so forth okay so now I
wanted to say a few words about cancer

00:36:03.560 --> 00:36:07.820
this is one of the active areas of
research in epigenetics and drug design

00:36:07.820 --> 00:36:16.070
for epigenetic effects and so if we can
go back to our smartphone metaphor now

00:36:16.070 --> 00:36:20.690
remember before we said that the DNA is
kind of like the hardware and then the

00:36:20.690 --> 00:36:25.099
epigenetic program is kind of like the
